WEBVTT

00:00:02.397 --> 00:00:03.627
Oh yeah.

00:00:03.627 --> 00:00:05.427
First mission in the bag.

00:00:05.427 --> 00:00:06.687
It was easy.

00:00:06.687 --> 00:00:07.767
Too easy?

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:08.817
Maybe.

00:00:08.817 --> 00:00:09.957
Maybe it was.

00:00:09.957 --> 00:00:11.007
[HAPPY GROWL]

00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:15.677
(SINGING) Come on now, won't
you ride on a fantastic--

00:00:15.677 --> 00:00:17.607
Hey, big fella.

00:00:17.607 --> 00:00:18.657
What did I do?

00:00:18.657 --> 00:00:20.157
I just rescued a tiger.

00:00:20.157 --> 00:00:21.357
Now, I'm not even
trying to brag.

00:00:21.357 --> 00:00:22.737
I'm just telling
you what happened.

00:00:22.737 --> 00:00:24.297
See, that's the thing
about being awesome.

00:00:24.297 --> 00:00:26.697
When you're awesome, and
you just tell the truth,

00:00:26.697 --> 00:00:28.467
it sounds like you bragging.

00:00:28.467 --> 00:00:30.727
Let me know when you
finish tooting your horn.

00:00:30.727 --> 00:00:32.777
Because we got to find
a safe place for Hu.

00:00:32.777 --> 00:00:33.827
Uh, what?

00:00:33.827 --> 00:00:34.877
What are you talking about?

00:00:34.877 --> 00:00:36.277
[CRASH]

00:00:38.497 --> 00:00:40.417
[CUTE PURR]
- Oh, yeah.

00:00:40.417 --> 00:00:42.107
Oh that guy.
Yeah.

00:00:42.107 --> 00:00:43.357
Oh.

00:00:43.357 --> 00:00:44.937
Yeah.
Oh!

00:00:44.937 --> 00:00:45.987
I got it.

00:00:45.987 --> 00:00:47.937
I know a guy whose
owner is never home.

00:00:47.937 --> 00:00:49.287
Yeah.
We can just take them there.

00:00:49.287 --> 00:00:50.487
Sounds like a plan.

00:00:50.487 --> 00:00:52.367
Super bunny, powers activate.

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:53.847
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:53.847 --> 00:00:55.837
[CLANG]

00:00:55.837 --> 00:00:57.327
[CLANG]

00:00:58.767 --> 00:00:59.817
[CRASH]

00:00:59.817 --> 00:01:01.717
Wait out here, buddy.

00:01:01.717 --> 00:01:04.137
Ugh, oh, ah.

00:01:04.137 --> 00:01:05.657
We'll be right back, OK?

00:01:05.657 --> 00:01:07.547
[PURR]

00:01:07.547 --> 00:01:10.047
POPS (SINGING): I'm a
puppy, cute and sweet.

00:01:10.047 --> 00:01:12.327
Beg real nice, and get a treat.

00:01:12.327 --> 00:01:16.017
Hip, hip, hip, hip, hip, hip.

00:01:16.017 --> 00:01:17.507
- Hey, Pops.
- Who's there?

00:01:17.507 --> 00:01:19.007
Bunny, bunny.
Bunny, bunny.

00:01:19.007 --> 00:01:20.057
Bunny!

00:01:20.057 --> 00:01:21.537
Uh, ah, ah.

00:01:21.537 --> 00:01:22.587
I'm a hero.

00:01:22.587 --> 00:01:23.937
I need you to respect that.

00:01:23.937 --> 00:01:24.987
All right.

00:01:24.987 --> 00:01:26.277
All right.

00:01:26.277 --> 00:01:28.827
Kid, hut.

00:01:28.827 --> 00:01:29.877
Ugh.

00:01:29.877 --> 00:01:32.337
Puppy school is in session.

00:01:32.337 --> 00:01:33.387
Puppy school?

00:01:33.387 --> 00:01:35.257
Now, the daily pledge.

00:01:35.257 --> 00:01:36.357
I promise--

00:01:36.357 --> 00:01:37.887
I promise--

00:01:37.887 --> 00:01:39.237
--to listen to Pops.

00:01:39.237 --> 00:01:40.797
--to listen to Pops.

00:01:40.797 --> 00:01:44.277
And learn how to be adorable,
wide-eyed and loving--

00:01:44.277 --> 00:01:48.927
And learn how to be adorable,
wide-eyed, and loving--

00:01:48.927 --> 00:01:51.407
To get what I
want, when I want it.

00:01:51.407 --> 00:01:54.807
To get what I
want, when I want it.

00:01:54.807 --> 00:01:56.767
OK, now, Pops quiz.

00:01:56.767 --> 00:02:00.057
Myron has hidden socks
all over the room.

00:02:00.057 --> 00:02:02.637
Now, what do we do
with human socks?

00:02:02.637 --> 00:02:03.927
Oh, me, me.

00:02:03.927 --> 00:02:06.027
Go ahead, Princess.

00:02:06.027 --> 00:02:08.397
We hid them, Mr. Pops.

00:02:08.397 --> 00:02:09.627
POPS (SINGING): Correct-arooni.

00:02:09.627 --> 00:02:11.787
And why do we hide them?

00:02:11.787 --> 00:02:16.597
Not knowing where one sock is
messes with the humans' minds.

00:02:16.597 --> 00:02:17.907
Heck, yes, it does.

00:02:17.907 --> 00:02:19.317
Always keep them guessing.

00:02:19.317 --> 00:02:21.027
Now, go find those socks.

00:02:21.027 --> 00:02:22.347
Quit.
OK.

00:02:22.347 --> 00:02:23.397
All right.
OK.

00:02:23.397 --> 00:02:24.657
Hey, Pops, what--
OK.

00:02:24.657 --> 00:02:26.637
That's enough.
What's going on?

00:02:26.637 --> 00:02:27.687
Yeah.

00:02:27.687 --> 00:02:29.787
My owner got a new puppy.

00:02:29.787 --> 00:02:31.287
My name's Tiny.

00:02:31.287 --> 00:02:33.027
Nobody cares.

00:02:33.027 --> 00:02:35.637
I was teaching Tiny how
not to be anyone's sucker.

00:02:35.637 --> 00:02:36.687
Word got out.

00:02:36.687 --> 00:02:38.877
Suddenly every puppy
in the tri-state area

00:02:38.877 --> 00:02:40.327
is scratching at my door.

00:02:40.327 --> 00:02:41.377
Ugh.

00:02:41.377 --> 00:02:42.447
Oh.

00:02:42.447 --> 00:02:43.647
Professor Pops?

00:02:43.647 --> 00:02:44.817
Yes, Pickles?

00:02:44.817 --> 00:02:46.317
I got to make a poop.

00:02:46.317 --> 00:02:48.507
Oh, you know where to do that.

00:02:48.507 --> 00:02:49.977
Find a shoe.

00:02:49.977 --> 00:02:51.597
[CHUCKLES]

00:02:51.597 --> 00:02:53.007
This is so sweet.

00:02:53.007 --> 00:02:54.357
Yeah.
They're good.

00:02:54.357 --> 00:02:55.917
[GROWL]
- Holy cheese and crackers.

00:02:55.917 --> 00:02:57.357
What is that?

00:02:57.357 --> 00:02:58.737
Myron, horn!

00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:00.267
Hm?
[LOUD HORN]

00:03:00.267 --> 00:03:01.317
[DRAMATIC MUSIC]

00:03:01.317 --> 00:03:02.667
[CONFUSED GROWL]

00:03:05.937 --> 00:03:07.097
No, no, no.
No, no.

00:03:07.097 --> 00:03:08.427
Look.
Look.

00:03:08.427 --> 00:03:09.477
It's OK.
[VIOLIN MUSIC]

00:03:09.477 --> 00:03:11.997
This beautiful creature is Hu.

00:03:11.997 --> 00:03:16.227
And the good news, is
he's staying with you.

00:03:16.227 --> 00:03:19.467
Get that tiger out of here
before he does any more damage.

00:03:19.467 --> 00:03:21.207
But we don't have
anywhere else to take him.

00:03:21.207 --> 00:03:22.857
Well, he ain't staying here.

00:03:22.857 --> 00:03:24.657
Kitty, kitty, kitty, kitty.

00:03:24.657 --> 00:03:26.887
No, what are you--
don't get attached.

00:03:26.887 --> 00:03:28.227
That thing is out.

00:03:28.227 --> 00:03:29.277
Oh.

00:03:32.227 --> 00:03:33.807
Oh, Pickles.

00:03:33.807 --> 00:03:35.287
Did you poop in a shoe?

00:03:35.287 --> 00:03:36.967
I put in a boot.

00:03:36.967 --> 00:03:39.007
He probably won't
find it for weeks.

00:03:39.007 --> 00:03:40.937
[GIGGLES]

00:03:40.937 --> 00:03:42.457
[SNIFFING]
[SUBDUED MUSIC]

00:03:42.457 --> 00:03:43.667
- Are you crying?
- What?

00:03:43.667 --> 00:03:44.717
No.

00:03:44.717 --> 00:03:46.877
You're crying.

00:03:46.877 --> 00:03:51.037
But I'm so proud of Pickles.

00:03:51.037 --> 00:03:53.727
Mr. Pops, please can
the tiger stay with us?

00:03:53.727 --> 00:03:54.947
Please?

00:03:54.947 --> 00:03:55.997
Please?

00:03:55.997 --> 00:03:57.047
Please?

00:03:57.047 --> 00:03:59.247
Please?

00:03:59.247 --> 00:04:00.357
Oh.

00:04:00.357 --> 00:04:01.767
Myron, look away.

00:04:01.767 --> 00:04:03.697
[ADORABLE WHIMPERING]

00:04:05.147 --> 00:04:07.307
POPS (SINGING): Oh, flapdoodle.

00:04:07.307 --> 00:04:08.647
OK, fine.
One night.

00:04:08.647 --> 00:04:09.697
Yaay!

00:04:09.697 --> 00:04:10.747
Yaay!

00:04:10.747 --> 00:04:11.917
[CHEERING]

00:04:12.967 --> 00:04:14.867
I taught you guys too well.

00:04:14.867 --> 00:04:17.427
[BLOWS NOSE]

00:04:17.427 --> 00:04:18.477
[SINISTER MUSIC]

00:04:18.477 --> 00:04:20.467
[MONKEY CHIRPING]

00:04:22.957 --> 00:04:25.397
[MONKEY CHIRPING]

00:04:25.397 --> 00:04:26.447
Mm!

00:04:30.927 --> 00:04:32.417
[WHIMPERING]

00:04:32.417 --> 00:04:34.927
[WHIMPERING]

00:04:34.927 --> 00:04:38.167
I give wolves one job.

00:04:38.167 --> 00:04:40.057
Guard white tiger.

00:04:40.057 --> 00:04:43.607
And you wolves, you blow it.

00:04:43.607 --> 00:04:47.137
Maybe I should make juggling
monkey head of security.

00:04:47.137 --> 00:04:48.187
[MONKEY CHIRPING]

00:04:48.187 --> 00:04:49.887
What say you, Little Sergei?

00:04:49.887 --> 00:04:51.697
[MONKEY CHIRPING]

00:04:51.697 --> 00:04:52.747
Yes.

00:04:52.747 --> 00:04:55.267
You are so smart.

00:04:55.267 --> 00:04:57.637
And then, there is this one.

00:04:57.637 --> 00:04:59.257
You are the worst wolf ever.

00:04:59.257 --> 00:05:00.667
[WHIMPERING]

00:05:00.667 --> 00:05:02.167
I swear, I--

00:05:02.167 --> 00:05:03.537
oh!

00:05:03.537 --> 00:05:05.367
[GROWLING]

00:05:06.737 --> 00:05:08.797
What this?

00:05:08.797 --> 00:05:13.897
[SNIFF] This from
thief of tiger.

00:05:13.897 --> 00:05:15.317
[GROWLING]
[SCARY MUSIC]

00:05:15.317 --> 00:05:16.367
Yes, smell.

00:05:16.367 --> 00:05:17.847
[SNIFFING AND SNARLING]

00:05:17.847 --> 00:05:22.777
[EVIL CHUCKLE]

00:05:22.777 --> 00:05:24.747
[GROWLING AND SNARLING]

00:05:26.227 --> 00:05:28.157
You bring that tiger back.

00:05:28.157 --> 00:05:30.817
And if you don't, that one--

00:05:30.817 --> 00:05:31.867
[WHIMPER]

00:05:31.867 --> 00:05:34.407
--will be a new coat
for Little Sergei.

00:05:34.407 --> 00:05:36.267
[MONKEY CHIRPING]

00:05:38.257 --> 00:05:40.737
[HOWLING]

00:05:40.737 --> 00:05:42.727
[SNARLING AND GROWLING]

